---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import CtaBand from '@/components/CtaBand.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '@/data/schema';
---

<Layout
  title={`About ${site.practitioner.name} | Face Crease Police® Hoylake`}
  description={`Meet ${site.practitioner.name}, the ${site.practitioner.role} behind Face Crease Police in Hoylake, Wirral.`}
  path="/about/"
  schema={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'About', path: '/about/' }])]}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-600">About</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-5xl">
      Clinical training first. Aesthetics second.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-900/70">
      {site.name} is led by {site.practitioner.name}, an {site.practitioner.role}. {site.practitioner.credentials}
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      {[
        ['Masters-level training', 'Advanced clinical assessment skills that go beyond standard aesthetic courses.'],
        ['Independent prescriber', 'Qualified to prescribe and administer prescription-only medicines directly.'],
        ['NMC registered', 'Regulated and accountable to the Nursing & Midwifery Council at all times.'],
      ].map(([title, desc]) => (
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-900/10 bg-white p-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">{title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-900/65">{desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="prose-clinic mt-14">
      <h2>Why {site.name}?</h2>
      <p>
        The name is a nod to the job: to police, not chase, facial ageing — spotting the difference between what
        actually needs treatment and what doesn't. {site.name} exists because too much aesthetic treatment is sold
        by people without the clinical training to say "no" or "not yet".
      </p>
      <p>
        As a nurse prescriber, {site.practitioner.name} works from clinical judgement rather than a treatment menu.
        That means an honest opinion on what will and won't make a visible difference, a conservative approach to
        dosing and product, and treatment plans that are reviewed and adjusted — not sold as a one-off transaction.
      </p>
      <h2>Trading name</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} is a trade name of {site.legalName}, registered in England &amp; Wales. All clinical
        responsibility for treatment sits with {site.practitioner.name} as the treating prescriber.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Layout>
